      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "# Wholesale Customers Segmentation\n",
        "\n",
        "This project uses K-Means Clustering to segment wholesale distribution clients based on their annual spending across product categories such as Fresh food, Milk, Grocery, Frozen items, Detergents and Paper, and Delicatessen. Without relying on any predefined labels, the goal is to identify natural client groups, such as high volume fresh food buyers or grocery focused retailers, enabling the business to design targeted supply and pricing strategies for each segment."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "OMDYxRINRAst"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
