        "### Business Insights\n",
        "\n",
        "**Cluster 0 (Grocery Focused, Moderate Buyers):** These clients purchase moderate amounts of Grocery, Milk, and Detergents Paper but relatively little Fresh produce, likely representing small retailers or convenience stores.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Cluster 1 (Fresh Food Specialists):** This segment shows significantly high spending on Fresh produce compared to other categories, indicating clients such as restaurants or hotels that rely heavily on fresh ingredients. Specialized fast delivery services for perishable goods would benefit this group.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Cluster 2 (Large Grocery and Milk Buyers):** These clients show the highest spending in Grocery, Milk, and Detergents Paper, suggesting large supermarkets or wholesale retailers. Bulk pricing and dedicated account management would be valuable for this segment.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Cluster 3 (Small, Low Volume Buyers):** This is the largest segment with consistently low spending across all categories, representing small scale clients. Standard, cost efficient service is most appropriate here.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Cluster 4 (Extreme Bulk Buyers):** A very small but high value segment with exceptionally high spending across almost all categories, particularly Frozen and Delicassen items, likely representing large hotel chains or catering businesses. These clients should be prioritized for premium service and dedicated account support.\n",
